    &\iff \measuredangle XAD+(\measuredangle CBA+90^\circ)=\measuredangle DAB
    &\iff \measuredangle XAD+\measuredangle DAO_1=\measuredangle DAB
    &\iff \measuredangle XAO_1=\measuredangle CAX
.\end{align*}

Thus it suffices to prove that  $AD$  and  $AX$  are pairs of isogonals w.r.t.  $\angle BAC$ .

