We see that  $\angle CAQ-\angle A=\angle CBQ-\angle B$ , so taking the  $\sqrt{bc}$  inverse, we see that
\[\angle CPA-\angle A=\angle CPB-\angle B,\]
which is easily shown to implies  $MK=ML$ .

