	\implies 2^{2^{18} - 1} &> 2^4 \cdot 2^{11 \cdot 2^{11}} 
	\implies 2^{2^{18} - 1} &> 11 \cdot 2048^{2048} 
	\implies 2^{2^{2^{18} - 1}} &> 2^{11 \cdot 2048^{2048}} 
	\implies 2^{2^{2^{18} - 1}} &> 2048^{2048^{2048}} 
	\implies 2^{2^{2^{18} - 1}} &> 2010^{2010^{2010}}.
\end{align*}

We now illustrate a sequence of moves that accomplishes the goal. We have
\begin{align*}
